td><a href="./user/reference/club-registry">Club Registry</a> / <a href="./user/reference/competitor-registry">Competitor Registry</a></td></tr><tr><td>Allocate start times</td><td><a href="./user/event-setup/start-times">Start times</a></td></tr><tr><td>Run a carnival scored over several days</td><td><a href="./user/event-setup/multi-stage-events">Multi-stage events</a></td></tr><tr><td>Run a knock-out sprint (heats, semis, finals)</td><td><a href="./user/event-setup/knock-out-competitions">Knock-out competitions</a></td></tr><tr><td>Draw a start list (intervals, club separation, ranking)</td><td><a href="./user/event-setup/start-draw">Drawing start times</a></td></tr><tr><td>Seed a start list from a ranking list</td><td><a href="./user/event-setup/start-draw#drawing-by-ranking">Drawing by ranking</a> / <a href="./user/event-setup/import-event-data#importing-rankings-from-a-csv">Importing rankings from a CSV</a></td></tr><tr><td>Understand the dashboard during an event</td><td><a href="./user/running-the-event/dashboard">The event dashboard</a></td></tr><tr><td>See which competitors are still out on the course</td><td><a href="./user/running-the-event/who-is-still-on-course">Seeing who is still on course</a></td></tr><tr><td>Confirm everyone is back / nobody is left on the course</td><td><a href="./user/running-the-event/safety-check">Safety check: accounting for everyone</a></td></tr><tr><td>Download a card at the finish</td><td><a href="./user/running-the-event/card-download">Downloading cards</a></td></tr><tr><td>Print splits for competitors (and choose where the printers go)</td><td><a href="./user/running-the-event/splits-printing">Printing splits</a></td></tr><tr><td>Download cards on a separate laptop (HTTPS / certificate)</td><td><a href="./user/reference/https-and-certificates">HTTPS and certificates</a></td></tr><tr><td>Work out which link to give a laptop, phone or TV</td><td><a href="./user/reference/server-addresses">Reaching the server: name or IP</a>